# case_04_alu_xprop directed schedule (benchmark-spec section 4).
# Columns: rst_n in_valid a(hex) b(hex) cfg_we cfg_sel
# c0: all operand bits differ -> unknown selector yields xxxxxxxx (mutant).
# c1: equal operands -> known 5A even with an unknown selector.
# c2: configure sel=1, no input.
# c3: valid input uses the (now known) selector -> 0x34.
# c4: no input.
1 1 00 FF 0 0
1 1 5A 5A 0 0
1 0 00 00 1 1
1 1 12 34 0 0
1 0 00 00 0 0
1 0 00 00 0 0
1 0 00 00 0 0
1 0 00 00 0 0
1 0 00 00 0 0
1 0 00 00 0 0
1 0 00 00 0 0
1 0 00 00 0 0
1 0 00 00 0 0
